of these subpattern causes catastrophic backtracking.</span></span>
<span id="A2.p4.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p4.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Analyze the following pattern; you have to answer the repaired version of the
entire pattern, not only a repaired subpattern: <code id="A2.p4.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">{pattern}</code></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="176.54" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 176.54" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,176.54) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.87 L 0 172.67 C 0 174.81 1.73 176.54 3.87 176.54 L 649.28 176.54 C 651.42 176.54 653.15 174.81 653.15 172.67 L 653.15 3.87 C 653.15 1.73 651.42 0 649.28 0 L 3.87 0 C 1.73 0 0 1.73 0 3.87 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 3.87 L 1.11 154.27 L 652.04 154.27 L 652.04 3.87 C 652.04 2.35 650.8 1.11 649.28 1.11 L 3.87 1.11 C 2.35 1.11 1.11 2.35 1.11 3.87 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9D9;" fill="#D9D9D9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 155.38 L 1.11 172.67 C 1.11 174.2 2.35 175.43 3.87 175.43 L 649.28 175.43 C 650.8 175.43 652.04 174.2 652.04 172.67 L 652.04 155.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.35 162)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="544.77"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
