<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Behavioral differences between models</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following is selected examples which highlight the difference between
non-reasoning (Phi4) and reasoning (Qwen3) models. They utilize two strategies:</p>
<ol id="A5.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A5.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="A5.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">match-all symbol ‘<span id="A5.I1.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span>’ 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A5.I1.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> character class ‘<code id="A5.I1.ix1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">[...]</code>’</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(b)</span> 
<div id="A5.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">unbounded repetition ‘<span id="A5.I1.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">*</span>’ and ‘<span id="A5.I1.ix2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">+</span>’ 
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A5.I1.ix2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> bounded repetition ‘<code id="A5.I1.ix2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">{n,m}</code>’</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="A5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">This distinct strategic behavior results in the non-reasoning model applying
(a), (a, b), and (a, b) sequences, while the reasoning model uses (a), (b), and
(b), yielding a more syntactically similar repair.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="368.22" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 368.22" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,368.22) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#666666;" fill="#666666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.87 L 0 364.35 C 0 366.49 1.73 368.22 3.87 368.22 L 649.28 368.22 C 651.42 368.22 653.15 366.49 653.15 364.35 L 653.15 3.87 C 653.15 1.73 651.42 0 649.28 0 L 3.87 0 C 1.73 0 0 1.73 0 3.87 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 3.87 L 1.11 345.84 L 652.04 345.84 L 652.04 3.87 C 652.04 2.35 650.8 1.11 649.28 1.11 L 3.87 1.11 C 2.35 1.11 1.11 2.35 1.11 3.87 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9D9;" fill="#D9D9D9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 346.94 L 1.11 364.35 C 1.11 365.88 2.35 367.12 3.87 367.12 L 649.28 367.12 C 650.8 367.12 652.04 365.88 652.04 364.35 L 652.04 346.94 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.35 353.57)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="544.77"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:39.37em;">
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#262626;">Repair with different syntactics</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.35 14.04)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:45.27em;--ltx-fo-height:23.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="325.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 322.33)" width="626.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:45.27em;">
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Original:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">^\n*(.*?)\s*$</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Phi4:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">^\n{0,1000}(.{0,1000})\s{0,1000}$</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Qwen3:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">^\n*[\s\S]*\s*$</code></span></span>
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:452.7pt;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span></span>
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Original:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">image:: (.*\.png)</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Phi4:
<br class="ltx_break">  
<code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">image:: ([\u0000-...-\u007f]{0,1000}\.png)</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Qwen3:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.3.1.3" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">image:: (.{0,500}\.png)</code></span></span>
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_rule ltx_filled_leader" style="width:452.7pt;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span></span>
<span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Original:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">/i18n/(.+)\.json$</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Phi4:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">/i18n/([\u0000-\uFFFF]{1,100})\.json</code>
<br class="ltx_break">Repaired by Qwen3:
<br class="ltx_break">  <code id="A5.p2.pic1.2.5.1.3" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">/i18n/(.{0,500})\.json$</code></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
